{"ID":"20240205153904-zs3aiua","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153904-zs3aiua","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153904-zs3aiua\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113130-xcajgxr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607144729-p4s6o02\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1534,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617110558-tzu37kz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:125,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:125\u0026#125;","title":"105辛夷（白玉兰、望春玉兰）","type":"doc","updated":"20240812173110"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240811111321-6tm7308","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20240811111321-6tm7308","updated":"20240812173110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"错录内容（已收纳）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240206113130-xcajgxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240206113130-xcajgxr","updated":"20240812173012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于安徽、河南、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t望春花：该品呈长卵形，似毛笔头，长1.22.5cm，直径0.81.5cm。基部常具短梗，长约5mm，梗上有类白色点状皮孔。苞片23层，每层2片，两层苞片间有小鳞芽，苞片外表面密被灰白色或灰绿色茸毛，内表面类棕色，无毛。花被片9，类棕色，外轮花被片3，条形，约为内两轮长的1/4，呈萼片状，内两轮花被片6，每轮3，轮状排列。雄蕊和雌蕊多数，螺旋状排列。体轻，质脆。气芳香，味辛凉而稍苦。玉兰：长1.53cm，直径11.5cm。基部枝梗较粗壮，皮孔浅棕色。苞片外表面密被灰白色或灰绿毛茸毛。花被片9，内外轮同型。武当玉兰：长24cm，直径12cm。枝梗粗壮，皮孔红棕色。苞片外表面密被淡黄色或淡黄绿色茸毛，有的最外层苞片茸毛已脱落而呈黑褐色。花被片1012"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15，内外轮无显著差异。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t祛风，通窍。治头痛，鼻渊，鼻塞不通，齿痛。\n【注解】\t“毛笔头”：指辛夷药材呈长卵形，外被长茸毛，形似毛笔之笔头。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113131-eo37xw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240206113131-eo37xw3","updated":"20240812173012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 526px;","style":"width: 516px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113131-mi6yk1c.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 516px;\" parent-style=\"width: 526px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 514px;","style":"width: 504px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"辛夷 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/辛夷 1-20240717183950-mapg55n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 504px;\" parent-style=\"width: 514px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811113419-5we3emq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240811113419-5we3emq","updated":"20240812173012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 524px;","style":"width: 514px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"辛夷"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/辛夷-20240205155224-1qlgymn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 514px;\" parent-style=\"width: 524px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 755px;","style":"width: 745px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620164658-6p5845d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Typ